      "gradio": "declared by qwen-tts and imported only by its demo (qwen_tts/cli/demo.py), which nothing the worker imports reaches; read against the 0.1.1 wheel",
      "torchaudio": "resolved from the publisher's cu128 index at install time, beside torch, because the PyPI build is built against another torch and qwen_tts imports torchaudio at module level",
      "hf-xet": "huggingface-hub declares it behind a marker that spells the machine \"amd64\" in lower case while Windows reports \"AMD64\", so pip does not install it there either; it accelerates downloads the worker never makes"
    },
